    "description": "C. Marsden Huggins\nPortrait of an Elder Smoking a Pipe\nArt Print on Paper\n19\" x 23\" (Framed)\nSigned in print lower left\nThis evocative portrait by Zimbabwean artist Cleta Marsden-Huggins depicts an African elder cupping his hands around a pipe. Active during the mid-20th century, Marsden-Huggins was celebrated for detailed figurative studies and African wildlife works. This piece showcases the artist's mastery of tonal shading and fine cross-hatching, capturing deep facial character, hands, and draped clothing with striking realistic presence.\nFine monochrome sketch-style print with detailed rendering and expressive texture\nFeatures printed artist signature \"C Marsden Huggins\" at the lower left\nFramed in a black wood frame with off-white mat and ready-to-hang wire on verso\nFrame measures approximately 19\" wide by 23\" high\nCondition:\nVery good condition overall. The artwork is clean beneath the glass with mild age toning to paper. Frame exhibits minor cosmetic scuffs and edge wear consistent with handling, but remains structurally sound.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
